<!-- Template Description -->
This template is used to link to users in [[Project:Admin noticeboard|admin noticeboard]] reports.

'''Result''' : {{user|Game widow}}

== Usage ==
{{tlx|user|username}}<br>
{{tlx|user|username|blocklog{{=}}n}}

=== Parameters ===

; username
: Self explanatory. When not used, "Example" shows.
; blocklog
: Optional. Set this parameter to hide the block log link.

